They'll have music.

00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:11.250
After you're done shooting,
you can have some beer or wine

00:24:11.250 --> 00:24:14.664
and it's a family affair
and so they kept that alive.

00:24:14.664 --> 00:24:18.497
- (speaking foreign language)

